WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.020
First, a figure wrapped in chains.

2
00:00:03.070 --> 00:00:06.070
Its speech bubble overflows with words.

3
00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:09.400
Then a small glowing figure, talking.

4
00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:12.760
Then a giant with a torch, talking too.

5
00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:14.880
Last, a tall hooded shape.

6
00:00:14.930 --> 00:00:20.770
"The Phantom slowly, gravely,
silently, approached."

7
00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:22.820
Its bubble stays empty.

8
00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:25.330
Three spirits talk and talk.

9
00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:28.220
So why does the last one never say a word?

10
00:00:28.270 --> 00:00:33.280
In this mission, you'll line up all four
ghosts and see what job each one does.

11
00:00:33.330 --> 00:00:37.260
You'll see how Dickens uses the
ghost-story genre to teach a moral.

12
00:00:37.310 --> 00:00:40.250
And you'll study the last spirit up close:

13
00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:44.750
a deep black garment, and
"one outstretched hand".

14
00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:49.570
Your mission: explain why the last
ghost never says a single word.
